  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - Reason for Refusal:\r\n\r\nThe proposed roof extension to form roof lantern to the main flat roof, by virtue of its bulk, mass, scale, and design, would appear as an incongruous and unsympathetic addition to the roofscape that would harm the character and appearance of the host building, the street scene, and wider Dartmouth Park Conservation Area, contrary to policies D1 (Design) and D2 (Heritage) of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan 2017, and Policy DC4 of The Dartmouth Park Neighbourhood Plan (2020)."
  ],
